{"id":"2a8ab98bbdc29f05","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-conditional-rewrite-step.md","title":"条件归约的最小分层语义","display":"df-conditional-rewrite-step — 条件归约的最小分层语义","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-replace]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]"],"label":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step","aliases":["56-df-conditional-rewrite-step"],"display":"df-conditional-rewrite-step — 条件归约的最小分层语义","type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definitions 3.5.3–3.5.5 and Exercise 3.5.6, printed pp82–84","source_ocr_block":"103–105","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae58bbf1212091b2\" href=\"?note=ae58bbf1212091b2\" title=\"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule\">56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-conditional-rewrite-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conditional-rewrite-step — 条件归约的最小分层语义"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definitions 3.5.3–3.5.5 and Exercise 3.5.6, printed pp82–84"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"103–105"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，项位置、子项与替换子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>；对关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq T^2\">\\(X\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow_X^*\">\\(\\leftrightarrow_X^*\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的自反、对称、传递闭包，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i,d_i\">\\(c_i,d_i\\)</span> 是规则条件序列中的配对分量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_C(X)\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(l,r,((c_i,d_i))_{i&lt;k})\\in C\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\;(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;(c_i\\sigma\\leftrightarrow_X^*d_i\\sigma))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_C(X)\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(l,r,((c_i,d_i))_{i&lt;k})\\in C\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\;(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;(c_i\\sigma\\leftrightarrow_X^*d_i\\sigma))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Phi_C(X_n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\to_C\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Phi_C(X_n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\to_C\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_C t\\Longleftrightarrow(s,t)\\in\\to_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_C t\\Longleftrightarrow(s,t)\\in\\to_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definitions 3.5.3–3.5.5、Exercise 3.5.6（印刷 pp82–84，OCR 页块103–105）。半等式条件用转换，不可误换为合流/可汇合条件。正向有限条件保证分层递增，避免旧文直接循环定义与损坏的转换箭头。这里只定义半等式 CTRS，其他条件语义单列。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"ae58bbf1212091b2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$。替换 $\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，项位置、子项与替换子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-replace]]。给定 $s,t\\in T$；对关系 $X\\subseteq T^2$，$\\leftrightarrow_X^*$ 是 $X$ 的自反、对称、传递闭包，见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。$c_i,d_i$ 是规则条件序列中的配对分量。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$。替换 $\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，项位置、子项与替换子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-replace]]。给定 $s,t\\in T$；对关系 $X\\subseteq T^2$，$\\leftrightarrow_X^*$ 是 $X$ 的自反、对称、传递闭包，见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。$c_i,d_i$ 是规则条件序列中的配对分量。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$。替换 $\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，项位置、子项与替换子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-replace]]。给定 $s,t\\in T$；对关系 $X\\subseteq T^2$，$\\leftrightarrow_X^*$ 是 $X$ 的自反、对称、传递闭包，见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。$c_i,d_i$ 是规则条件序列中的配对分量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow_X^*","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"c_i,d_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_C(X)\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(l,r,((c_i,d_i))_{i<k})\\in C\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(s)\\;(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p\\land\\forall i<k\\;(c_i\\sigma\\leftrightarrow_X^*d_i\\sigma))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Phi_C(X_n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\to_C\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_C t\\Longleftrightarrow(s,t)\\in\\to_C.","display":true}],"bytes":1932,"backlinks":[{"id":"875e72f69ea30655","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本节点是实际读过的三种条件的共同编码。去重范围为本书目录；旧 [[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step]] 只定义模式0的完整系统语义，不能承担模式1、2的接口。此处仅形式化条件满足，不定义规则生成关系，避免与后续分层构造形成循环。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-281","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step.md]]"},{"id":"6159207e3a9c1add","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定半等式条件系统 $C$，令 $\\Phi_C,X_n,\\to_C$ 如 [[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step]]。$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，所有规则条件列表有限。"}],"outgoing":["ae58bbf1212091b2","6aa7f56f36c897f4","da02033e6d596cae","b58d01262349aaf3","9ddd157960e9574a"]}